Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a winter fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make it. My dream come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away the crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.74,0:01:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no afraid with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit me, I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you only wait out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We can let go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.82,0:01:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, grow up with a rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight it for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.47,0:01:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That I want, but you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that you can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.54,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.68,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Niko Robin just lovely how cowardly gave
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself the advantage I\Nwhat wait wait dear girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect me to fight fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, that's rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You have it backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, Rebecca's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Sincerely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Long have I waited for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just respectfully\Nmoving the corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't take it the wrong way. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure that\None's still alive, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.72,0:03:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair, but can we agree he's\Nknocked out cold, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,At least let us tend to\Nhis wounds, pretty please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you show us pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We appeal to your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, senor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola, you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.42,0:04:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please respond
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.82,0:04:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the princess? Or Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mess, our beloved princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How I worry for the girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.26,0:04:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I must know. There's news; it's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We ran into a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't see something happen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay on the line while\NI contact the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, can you hear me? Oh, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola We're running up the\Nrampart tower at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.52,0:04:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're approaching the chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you must to get there quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Giola has Princess Moncherry and is\Nforcing her to use her ability. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the little people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:04:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring in the explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a staircase, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up the pace! Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Princess Moncherie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop giving me a hard time, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Miss Greenbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please let me go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help you any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling Boa Hancock?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You misheard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:05:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to\Nlet the executives suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, they lost to our\Nenemies, but not by much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning the people they fought are\Nin pretty rough condition themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,if you'll work with me\Nhere and use your heal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-heal fruit powers to\Nrevive our executives,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll win!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be able to finish the job and\Nsend those louts to an early grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our foes will never see it coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,are you ready to use\Nthat Fancy Pants ability
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,like you did on Sugar\Nthe first time she lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hang that magic\Nwatering can over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:06:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You hurt King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I also found out that King\NDoflamingo has been lying to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And that was all for your own\Ngood, you know-nothing rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to heal bad guys like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.02,0:07:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for crocodile tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just call me the\Nbeauty of the millennium?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.56,0:07:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't care about your friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I heal all your people's wounds,\Nthey'll do bad things again, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hush, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I have no choice but to\Nwring the powers out of you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit something that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Cub!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo! Cub! Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.44,0:08:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's painful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, he's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Keeping secrets, little princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So even your tears have\Nthe ability to heal people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Weep those little eyes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's raining. Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, hurry! On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yola!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's figured out the\Nprincess's dearest heal people!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's forcing her to cry by\Ncallously inflicting pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:09:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mauji's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to Leo and Cub!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She sounds powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I get why they wanted her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of the heal heal fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's granted her the ability\Nto mend wounds of all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,living things and they're\Nforcing her to use it. Jeez,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I see damn. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're harming her It's a twisted attempt\Nto revitalize their defeated executives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be bad if they pull it off
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And I thought we were\Nin the clear Leo, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Cub, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar's there with them, too, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How the heck do we even the\Nodds when they keep coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, little guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The naughty room!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Drop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too late, hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, wake up, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Don Quixote family reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Round two, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You handle Giola. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uppaca!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So, so, so, so, so!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, so, so, so, so!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll line them up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have grabbed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me help you with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.94,0:12:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So, so, so!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So, so, so, so, so!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I strung you all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:13:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So your friends won't\Nget separated anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You what, Atlas fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot Couture!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Patchwork, go! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo really came to rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.66,0:13:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just like a real prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,was crafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time! He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:13:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The executives weren't revived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo stopped her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiny individuals!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsherry is with Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, I was scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.02,0:14:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you gain some weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Classic Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My leg was hurt bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you carry me on your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe in your arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go again,\Nacting like a big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can fix your own injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You have healing powers, you lazy dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I know you've\Nalways been a good runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop playing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.10,0:15:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I never asked for you to\Ncome here and save me, Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I put my life on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so ungrateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want me to leave you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.22,0:15:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just carry her out for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Selfish, fickle, despicable,\Nand mean-spirited.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a huge, huge pain in the patootie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His back feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our princess is just the sweetest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.42,0:15:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How thick-headed can Leo be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Big problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They took Mad Sherry and ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Go after the little people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They went that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit defeat, but\Nthe situation has become dire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't be thrilled, but I\Nmust report to the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I recall him saying that Mancherry's devil
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.18,0:16:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,fruit must have a hidden ultimate ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He believed that he could use that if\Nsomething happened to the Smile Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If she traded her life to call\Nforth that forbidden power,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,she could restore it to its former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Without that fail-safe,\Nwe could be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done, then\Nthe factory is in peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on you, señor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.48,0:16:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our last line of defense. Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor, please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He dove in the ground again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Farland, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the attack dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Suplex!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is Yarr!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.82,0:17:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor must be at his limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Froland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have easily dodged that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.24,0:17:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd we see you take the\Nsame move over and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, tontadas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Senor's also been hit with\Nthe same punch 30 times in a row, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone offers to\Nbuy a round at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a real man, then you wouldn't\Ndare take your glass off of the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.56,0:18:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting hit on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's a bro among bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna take every attack\Nhe throws at me out of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He can throw whatever he's got at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll still win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doing it strong style, baby
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cute that you're concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is a man's\Nfight So just stand back
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and watch me win don't\Nfret little friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you lose your freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words make me tipsier than\Nany dive bar I'd ever been to, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you\Nback up that fancy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This body's not as spry as it used to be,\Nso my next move is going to settle these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you two going to fight\Nwhen you're so far apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Signor, closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pervert, are you picking\Nup what I'm throwing down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.36,0:19:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'd take whatever\NI can hurl at you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,True men don't go back on their word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.16,0:19:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Surviving this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.62,0:19:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can withstand this\Nfinal blow, I'll take the loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll accept whatever attack\Nyou wish to dish out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He swam straight up the side of the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the heck is that\Nguy gonna do up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a mean-looking sky\Ntoday, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I can keep flying, then\Nmaybe I can see my Russian,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Russian, yeah, I'd like to see my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimlet too, unfortunately, gravity\Nis going to fight me on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't keep flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you rambling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Cyborg, your back's\Nstill flesh and blood, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.16,0:20:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You figured that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shut up before you\Nbite your own tongue off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow. Meow. Suplex!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.72,0:20:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.80,0:21:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.90,0:21:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Frawl 'n!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember your words, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll get to see what I'm made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:22:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Franky Iron Foxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now, Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The day I first met you, and\Nthe day you stopped smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That cold, dark rain kept\Npouring, just like in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.60,0:22:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a wet one out there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.50,0:22:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm drenched.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so amusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you freezing cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.20,0:22:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I love rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.20,0:22:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What things don't I like?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.66,0:22:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, pirates hate him to\Ndeath, so what do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm a... a banker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So, honey, what should we name him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,a Gimli.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.26,0:23:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that suits him fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimlet is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:23:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A week ago today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.48,0:24:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The same day you disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.34,0:24:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He came down with a sudden fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.32,0:24:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I rushed him to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But he didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.14,0:24:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.46,0:24:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.58,0:24:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I called the bank over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.22,0:24:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But they told me you were\Nnever employed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.66,0:24:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.92,0:24:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you really do for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did the money come from? Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.78,0:24:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.74,0:24:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.50,0:24:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have the right to\Nbe a father anymore Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.86,0:24:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.66,0:24:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Russian!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.40,0:24:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible out here
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.40,0:24:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You stop following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.42,0:24:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be alone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.50,0:24:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand, Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.00,0:24:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I can't\Ntell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.12,0:24:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Russian!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:24:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.02,0:24:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Russian!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.14,0:25:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wife is in critical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.60,0:25:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She was trapped under a\Nlandslide during the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.94,0:25:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She's awake, but unresponsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.02,0:25:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A vegetative state?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.22,0:25:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.48,0:25:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The trauma has left her\Nwith no signs of awareness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.20,0:25:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid she may never recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.88,0:25:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sad to say, the woman you\Nonce knew was no longer there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not entirely sure how\Nmuch time she has left either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.28,0:25:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you hadn't met me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.16,0:25:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This would have never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.14,0:25:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.58,0:25:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.52,0:25:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.62,0:25:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.54,0:25:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.54,0:25:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear you laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.68,0:26:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.14,0:26:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see your smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.88,0:26:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Russian, look here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.22,0:26:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the same bonnet that\Nour gimlet used to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.92,0:26:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't I look like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.44,0:26:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You used to say he had my face. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.84,0:26:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a poor joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.80,0:26:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And just imagine if somebody saw me...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.06,0:26:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Russian...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.58,0:26:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a Kaidou?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.00,0:27:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard he lost his son\Nand his wife's brain dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.46,0:27:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder he went off the deep end.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.34,0:27:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.86,0:27:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell happened to\Nyour fashion sense, Pink?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.44,0:27:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.16,0:27:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.30,0:27:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep walking, you perv.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.04,0:27:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What a creep. Look! It's a freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.10,0:27:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.90,0:27:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.26,0:28:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I look ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.26,0:28:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But to me, this silly outfit is\Nworth more than the finest suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.08,0:28:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The only time you smile for me\Nanymore is when I wear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.14,0:28:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, senor!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rollins, tell us that you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.56,0:29:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real mess, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.96,0:29:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going through your head right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.38,0:29:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's making you hurt like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, if we ever cross\Npaths again, let's have a round.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.92,0:29:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell me all about
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.06,0:29:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,that girl who goes by Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You
